  "description": "Cho Seong-woo is the ace of the ‘First Generation’ and the biggest star in Korean university basketball, and dreams of making it to the NBA. He possesses talent second to none, and is just as arrogant and self-centred.\n\nAnd Kang Seol-hyun, who looks up to him. Although he started playing basketball late and lacks both a dazzling career and overwhelming physical prowess, he works harder than anyone else and possesses an exceptional shooting instinct.\n\nOne day, Seol-hyun, a reserve player, gets the chance to play when the starting guard, Si-hoon, is injured, and finds himself playing alongside Seong-woo on the same team…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/five)",
